course: dictionary
lesson: 5543
title: Words for clothes and their clues
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words name things we wear, and the sentence around them tells us which thing it is. «Artificial grass scrapes bare skin more than real grass, so long socks, leggings or sliding shorts protect the legs.» Leggings are worn on the legs to protect them, like socks and shorts.
explain: Look for clue words such as sport, dance, snow or soldiers. «She wore black leggings and a T-shirt to dance class.» Dance and T-shirt tell you that leggings are tight, stretchy trousers worn for sport or everyday.
explain: Leggings are almost always plural, so you will usually meet them as a pair of leggings. The singular legging, meaning one leg of such a garment, is rare.
fact: Leggings are tight, stretchy trousers, usually worn by girls and women for sport, dance or everyday.
fact: Long ago, leggings were warm outer coverings for the legs, worn over trousers in snow, or by soldiers and riders.
fact: Leggings are almost always plural: we say a pair of leggings.
fact: The singular legging means one leg of such a garment, and it is rare.
fact: In Chinese, «qiūkù» means long johns or thermal leggings, literally "autumn trousers".
exercise: Ella wears «leggings and a T-shirt» to dance class. What are leggings? | A pair of shoes | A long, heavy coat | *Tight, stretchy trousers for sport or everyday | A hat with a brim
exercise: In «long socks, leggings or sliding shorts protect the legs», what are leggings for? | Holding up a skirt | *Protecting the legs | Keeping the head warm | Making the hands clean
exercise: Pupil asks why we say «a pair of leggings». Why? | Because leggings only come in one leg | *Because leggings are almost always plural | Because legging is a kind of shoe | Because a pair of leggings is a dance move
test: In long ago stories, soldiers and riders wore leggings as what? | Hats for the rain | Very thin socks | *Warm outer coverings over their trousers | Pyjamas
test: Which phrase uses leggings correctly? | *a pair of black leggings | legging black pair | a black leggings | blacks of leggings
exam: What does the Chinese word «qiūkù» mean? | A summer dress | *Long johns or thermal leggings | A kind of boots | Waterproof coats
